IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-AQLM-QUANT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ROWS-R              PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COLS-C              PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NUM-CODEBOOKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 DEQUANT-TOKS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-AQLM.
    IF ROWS-R == 0 OR COLS-C == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF NUM-CODEBOOKS == 0
        MOVE 8 TO NUM-CODEBOOKS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 5600 TO DEQUANT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CODEBOOKS.
    WEIGHT 30 DEQUANT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
